  "name": "LGD AI Autonomy x Pluggability - Evidence Bundle",
  "description": "Machine-readable evidence for the LGD demo: one real AI-self-remediation closed loop, the pluggable skill-package mechanism, outsider reproduction numbers, and badge issuances. Every number is traced to a repo-relative source file; unverifiable figures are omitted.",
  "datePublished": "2026-10-16",
